### Get all restaurants
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants

### Get restaurant by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants/1

### Filter restaurants by area
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants?area=Bole

### Get nonexistent restaurant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants/99

### Create restaurant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sishu",
  "area": "Kazanchis"
}

### Create restaurant with invalid data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "S",
  "area": "Invalid"
}

### Get all dishes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes

### Get dish by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/1

### Get nonexistent dish
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes/99

### Filter dishes by restaurant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/dishes?restaurantId=1

### Create dish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "name": "Special Kitfo",
  "priceSantim": 35000
}

### Create dish with invalid data
POST http://localhost:3000/api/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 99,
  "name": "A",
  "priceSantim": -500
}